## 3. Eligijus — Password Generation Logic

### Added / Modified Functions

```python
get_selected_characters()
generate_password()
```

### Changes Made

- Added logic to collect the character groups selected by the user.
- Allowed the user to choose letters, numbers, and symbols.
- Added input validation for password length.
- Checked whether at least one character group was selected.
- Ensured the generated password contains at least one character from every selected group.
- Used the `secrets` module for more secure password generation.

### Purpose

These changes improved the security and reliability of the password generator.  
Instead of simply generating a random string, the program now validates user choices and ensures that the generated password matches the selected requirements.

